# Testing Rules

## Framework

Vitest with Node environment.

## Allowed

- Unit tests for pure business logic (pricing, money, capacity rules)
- Tests colocated with source: `src/lib/money.test.ts`
- `pnpm test` / `pnpm test:watch`

## Forbidden

- Meaningless coverage-padding tests
- Testing framework internals
- Snapshot tests for business logic
- Tests that require a live database (use mocks)

## Priority test targets (Phase 2+)

- Pricing engine calculations
- Luggage/passenger capacity validation
- Vehicle eligibility rules
- Extra service total calculation
- Round-trip pricing behavior
- Money arithmetic (implemented in Phase 1)

## Run tests

```bash
pnpm test
```
